  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "3s",
      "6s",
      "15s",
      "30s",
      "1m"
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "ADWIN drift detected",
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "orange",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "demo-prometheus"
        },
        "expr": "changes(grid_demo_detections_total[6s]) > 0",
        "step": "3s",
        "titleFormat": "ADWIN drift detected",
        "textFormat": "Synthetic stream event; see /state for exact event records."
      },
      {
        "name": "Ridge model retrained",
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "cyan",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "demo-prometheus"
        },
        "expr": "changes(grid_demo_retrains_total[6s]) > 0",
        "step": "3s",
        "titleFormat": "Ridge model retrained",
        "textFormat": "Synthetic stream event; see /state for exact event records."
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "SYNTHETIC DEMO \u00b7 actual ADWIN detection and Ridge fitting",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**One new synthetic labeled sample every 3 seconds.** Predictions are made before the label is used. First injected relationship change: **sample 41 (~2 minutes)**; then every 160 samples (~8 minutes): **abrupt \u2192 gradual \u2192 incremental \u2192 structural**, repeating. Isolated generation spikes, missing temperature, negative solar readings and demand surges are also injected. ADWIN watches prediction error, not the injected regime flag. After detection, collect 24 new labels (72 seconds), fit Ridge on the latest 48 observations, then refit 24 labels later to complete recovery.\n\n**Separate demonstration model: no PUCSL live feed, no production-model updates, no 30-day classification protocol.** Metrics use the latest 20 pre-update predictions. Refresh/scrape: 3 seconds; display can lag by two cycles. Injection labels are generator truth; ADWIN does not classify drift types. Flagged samples are excluded from training/detection, but remain in error metrics. Restart stream to replay."
      }
    },
